         "step": 1,
         "text": "The x-coordinate is the known value plus the accumulated change: \\( x(3) = x(1) + \\int_{1}^{3} \\left(2 \\cos{\\left(\\frac{t^{2}}{3} \\right)}\\right)\\,dt \\).",
         "point_type_id": "BC-PT-99033",
